    "body": "thx for explanation @sleevi \r\nso i happened to return to reviewing the [obtain a connection](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-connection-obtain) section and was again sort of confused and having questions and then I recalled having submitted this issue. Upon re-reading this, I suppose that at least at this point, I'd say yes, omit \"TLS\" from \"If credentials is false, do not send a TLS certificate\", and consider expanding the existing Note to contain appropriate portions of https://github.com/whatwg/fetch/issues/641#issuecomment-348347808 and https://github.com/whatwg/fetch/issues/641#issuecomment-348347944 (above) such that there's less mystery regarding the admitted vagueness. \r\n",
